	<<endevent>>
	<<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
	<<cleareventpool>>

	<<addinlineevent "whitney_hang_gang_1">>
		<<generatey2>>
		You hang out with Whitney and <<his>> friends. They run a tournament in a fighting game, passing the controllers between them. Whitney makes it into the final round, along with a <<person2>><<person>>.
		<br><br>
		"You give me £50 if I win," Whitney says.
		<br>
		<<person1>><<His>> friend nods. "If I win, you have to climb out the window, and bring something back from a neighbour's flat."
		<br>
		Whitney laughs. "Alright, but I'll take the slut with me."
		<br><br>

		They play the final match. Whitney wins a round, followed by <<his>> friend. It's a best of three.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Distract Whitney|Whitney Home Gang Window Distract]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist1>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Do nothing|Whitney Home Gang Window Nothing]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>

